Speaker Notes:

text

MPDIS - the Marine Plastic Drift Intelligence System - is India's first 
frugal ocean pollution prediction platform. Unlike expensive satellites, 
we use ₹50,000 sensor nodes with AI that predicts where plastic will 
drift 24-48 hours in advance with 85% accuracy. Cleanup crews get 
actionable intelligence through 3D dashboards - arriving before pollution, 
not after disaster.
