Technology Stack Box:

text

🔧 TECH STACK

Hardware:           Software:              AI/ML:
• Arduino Uno/Mega  • React.js 18         • Python 3.9+
• DS18B20 Sensors   • Node.js 18          • TensorFlow 2.12
• TDS Meters        • Express.js          • PyTorch 2.0
