Let's talk competitive advantage. MPDIS isn't incrementally better - 
it's 99% cheaper at ₹50,000 per node versus ₹50 lakh satellites. We 
deliver real-time data versus 48-hour delays. Our patent-pending hybrid 
AI-physics model achieves 85% accuracy with 60% less training data. 
We're the first indigenous Indian solution, reducing foreign tech 
dependence. Most importantly, our open-source architecture makes ocean 
monitoring accessible to every coastal authority - not just elite 
research institutions.
