Impact isn't just about technology - it's about transformation. Our 
pilot projections show 40% reduction in coastal plastic, protecting 250 
endangered species. Economically, we save ₹200 crore annually while 
safeguarding ₹1.5 lakh crore in fisheries. Socially, 3,600 communities 
get pollution alerts, creating 500 jobs. Our roadmap? Phase 1: 20 nodes 
in Rameswaram by Q2 2026. Phase 2: 100 nodes across Tamil Nadu. Phase 
3: 500 nodes nationally. Phase 4: Export to SAARC nations. Every rupee 
invested returns ₹15 in savings.
